  </table>
  <div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>
  <div style="line-height: 1.25;">The maturity profile of the Company&#8217;s other financial liabilities (trade payables, other account payable and accrued expenses, and warrants) as of December 31, 2023, are less than one year.</div>
  <div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>
