  <div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>
  <div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25;">Operating activities from continuing operations used cash of $8,075 and $12,340 for the year ended December 31, 2023, and 2022, respectively. For the three months ended December 31, 2023, and 2022,
    operating activities from continuing operation used cash of $218 and $2,978, respectively. This variance is primarily due to increase in the business activities of the Company including corporate expenses for salaries, professional fees and marketing
    expenses in Israel and, Germany and related to the corporate activities in Canada.</div>
  <div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>
  <div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25;">Investing activities from continuing operations used cash of $1,182 and $793 for the year ended December 31, 2023, and 2022, respectively. For the three months ended December 31, 2023, and 2022,
    investing activities from continuing operation used cash of $629 and $580, respectively. Decrease derived from purchase of property, plant and equipment in the amount of $581.</div>
  <div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>
  <div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25;">Financing activities from continuing operations provided cash of $9,417 and $6,612 for the year ended December 31, 2023, and 2022, respectively. For the three months ended December 31, 2023, and 2022,
    financing activities used cash of $37 and provided cash of $2,668, respectively. Majority of the increase derived from issuance of share capital and warrants in the amount of $8,273, proceeds derived from discounted checks in the amount of $2,802,
    set-off by repayment of bank loan in the amount of $4,827 and receipt of bank loan in the amount of $5,482 in 2023.</div>
  <div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>
