        </td>
        <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top;">&#9679;</td>
        <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
          <div>the Company will realize upon its intentions to expand the business, operations and potential activities of the Company;</div>
        </td>
      </tr>

  </table>
  <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;" class="DSPFListTable" id="z95d8e213cd7e42bfa33e178b053f18e2">

