        <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
          <div>the competitive conditions of the cannabis industry and the growth of medical or adult-use recreational cannabis in the jurisdictions in which the Company operates;</div>
        </td>
      </tr>

  </table>
  <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;" class="DSPFListTable" id="z5fbe3122aeab43b1a4b3295354e7dcd0">

