          <div>the Company will commit to responsible growth and compliance with the strictest regulatory environments;</div>
        </td>
      </tr>

  </table>
  <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;" class="DSPFListTable" id="z7be73f4ed68142b6b22e01a366ab76c3">

